{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Lead [Bb7]me, [Cm]Lord, [Ab]lead [Eb]me [Fm]in [F7]Thy [Eb]righteous[Bb]nes[Bb7]s;
[Gm]Make Thy [Bb7]way [Cm]plain [Fm7]be[Eb]fore [Bb]my [Bb7][Eb]face.
[Eb]For [Bb7]it[Eb]is [Ab]Thou, [Eb]Lord, Thou, [Ab]Lord [Eb]on[Bb]ly,
[Bb7]That [Gm]mak[Cm]est [G]me [Cm]dwe[Cm7]ll[Fm7]in[Eb]sa[Bb]fe [Bb7] [Eb]ty.
{end_of_verse}
